## PSFN Design

### Dependency
Add `@sinclair/typebox` (~50KB, zero deps, MIT).

### Changes to SubstrateTool interface

```typescript
import { type TSchema, type Static } from '@sinclair/typebox';

export interface SubstrateTool<T extends TSchema = TSchema> {
  name: string;
  description: string;
  schema: T;  // replaces inputSchema: Record<string, unknown>
  execute: (input: Static<T>) => Promise<ToolResult>;
}
```

### Validation in agent-loop.ts

Before calling `tool.execute(call.input)`, validate with TypeBox:
```typescript
import { Value } from '@sinclair/typebox/value';

const valid = Value.Check(tool.schema, call.input);
if (!valid) {
  const errors = [...Value.Errors(tool.schema, call.input)];
  return { content: `Invalid arguments: ${errors.map(e => e.message).join(', ')}`, isError: true };
}
```

### Migration
- Update existing tools (think, spawn_shard, memory_write, contact_*, self_restart, self_rebuild) to use TypeBox schemas
- `getToolSchemas()` converts TypeBox schema to JSON Schema for wire format (TypeBox schemas ARE JSON Schema)
- Gateway protocol unchanged (already sends JSON Schema)

### Backward compat
Keep accepting `Record<string, unknown>` inputSchema as legacy — wrap in Type.Unsafe() for untyped tools.

